flowchart TD
    Start([Memory Management Module Entry]) --> ReadConfig[/Input Memory Block Sizes & Process Requests/]
    ReadConfig --> ValMem{Validate: Sizes > 0, Requests > 0}
    ValMem -- Error --> ErrorDisplay[Display Validation Error] --> ReadConfig
    ValMem -- Valid --> InitPool[Initialize Free Block Pool: id, size, free=True]

    InitPool --> ChooseAlgo{Choose Allocation Policy}
    ChooseAlgo -- First Fit --> StrategyFF[Scan blocks from start; pick first block >= request]
    ChooseAlgo -- Best Fit --> StrategyBF[Scan all free blocks; pick smallest block >= request]
    ChooseAlgo -- Worst Fit --> StrategyWF[Scan all free blocks; pick largest block >= request]

    StrategyFF --> IterProc[For each Process Request in sequence]
    StrategyBF --> IterProc
    StrategyWF --> IterProc

    IterProc --> SearchBlock{Suitable block found?}
    SearchBlock -- Yes --> CheckExact{block_size == req_size?}
    CheckExact -- Yes --> AllocExact[Allocate block directly: remaining = 0]
    CheckExact -- No --> SplitBlock[Split block: Allocate req_size, insert remaining into free pool]

    SearchBlock -- No --> MarkFailed[Mark process status: FAILED Insufficient Memory]
    AllocExact --> NextProc{More requests?}
    SplitBlock --> NextProc
    MarkFailed --> NextProc

    NextProc -- Yes --> IterProc
    NextProc -- No --> AuditFrag[Calculate External Fragmentation & Used Memory]
    AuditFrag --> RenderTable[/Display Allocation Results Table & Utilization Metrics/]
    RenderTable --> EndNode([Return])
